You are correct. The shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> dependency detector works by looking for library() and require() as well as double/triple colon function calls. Unfortunately it is not sophisticated enough to understand lapply.

Cheers
-Andy

On Tue, Mar 3, 2015 at 3:32 PM, Nikolay Braykov <nbra...@gmail.com> wrote:

